WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.108
"I’m dying," cried Toad from his room.

2
00:00:06.109 --> 00:00:10.064
"Get me a doctor, please!

3
00:00:10.065 --> 00:00:13.314
"Rat stood outside the door.

4
00:00:13.315 --> 00:00:18.169
"Look, Toad," said Rat, "it can’t be that bad."

5
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:22.769
"Ohhhh," moaned Toad.

6
00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:25.950
"Tomorrow you will say . . ."

7
00:00:25.951 --> 00:00:30.031
"What? What?" asked Rat.

8
00:00:30.032 --> 00:00:35.112
"You will say," Toad said sadly,

9
00:00:35.113 --> 00:00:40.230
"‘If only I had done something!’"

10
00:00:40.231 --> 00:00:44.273
Rat wasn’t sure what to do.

11
00:00:44.274 --> 00:00:49.300
"I’m not supposed to leave Toad," thought Rat.

12
00:00:49.301 --> 00:00:53.757
"Ohh," moaned Toad.

13
00:00:53.758 --> 00:00:57.784
"But what if he’s really sick?" Rat asked himself.

14
00:00:57.785 --> 00:01:02.247
"I’m dying, Rat," said Toad.

15
00:01:02.248 --> 00:01:08.514
"Say good-bye to everyone for me."

16
00:01:08.515 --> 00:01:16.260
"I’d better get a doctor," thought Rat.

17
00:01:16.261 --> 00:01:18.328
"Just to be safe."

18
00:01:18.329 --> 00:01:22.906
"I’ll be right back, Toad," said Rat. "Hang on!"

19
00:01:22.907 --> 00:01:30.289
Rat ran downstairs and out the door.

20
00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:34.465
Toad got up at once and put on his best suit.

21
00:01:34.466 --> 00:01:38.673
He opened a drawer to get some money.

22
00:01:38.674 --> 00:01:43.556
"Just a little cash," said Toad to himself.

23
00:01:43.557 --> 00:01:48.001
He stuffed his pockets with bills.

24
00:01:48.002 --> 00:01:51.425
"Let me see," said Toad.

25
00:01:51.426 --> 00:01:54.612
"Ah, the way out!"

26
00:01:54.613 --> 00:01:58.915
Toad knotted his sheets to make a rope.

27
00:01:58.916 --> 00:02:02.221
He lowered himself out the window.

28
00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:07.017
Toad sang a tune as he walked away.

29
00:02:07.018 --> 00:02:09.110
I fooled Rat,

30
00:02:09.111 --> 00:02:11.717
How wonderful is that?

31
00:02:11.718 --> 00:02:13.823
I fooled Rat,

32
00:02:13.824 --> 00:02:18.944
And that is that!

